                    "isToken": true,
                    "talentCandidates": [
                        {
                            "talentIndex": 0,
                            "description": "Gains +1 'Wolf Shadow' every 25s (up to a maximum of 3). For each 'Wolf Shadow' present, the Wolfpack gains +1 Block, and each attack inflicts an additional instance of damage; when more than 1 'Wolf Shadow' is present, each time upon taking lethal damage, loses 1 'Wolf Shadow' but fully restores HP, and the Wolfpack gains 30% Physical Dodge for 7 seconds.",
